[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……よし、いったん休憩にしよう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Alright, let's take a break."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふー……えへへ、歌も踊りも\n結構いい感じになってきたんじゃない？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Phew... hehe, I feel like our singing and dancing are really coming together!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いーや、まだまだね。\nイザナ、あんたは振りも歌も走りすぎ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Not even close. Izana, you're rushing both the choreography and the vocals."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はぁーい……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, ma'am..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本番まであと３日かあ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Only three days until the show..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "心配はいらぬ。現時点でこの完成度ならば、\n本番までには完璧に仕上げられるはず",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No need to worry. At the rate we're improving, we'll be polished to perfection by then."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ううん、そうじゃなくて。この三人で\n一緒にいられるのもあとそれだけなんだと思って……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, that's not it... I was just thinking that the three of us only have three more days together..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "…………",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、ごめんね！\u3000湿っぽい感じにしちゃって……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, sorry! I didn't mean to bring the mood down..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まあ、いいんじゃないの。少しくらいは。\n言ってることは本当なんだし",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's fine. A little goes a long way. And you're not wrong."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……なら、湿っぽい空気に便乗して、\n少し話をしてもよいか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...In that case, would you mind if I added to the mood for a moment?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なになに？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ooh, what is it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "かしこまって話すのも小恥ずかしいのだが……\n二人には、改めて感謝を伝えたい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It feels a little embarrassing to say out loud, but... I want to properly thank you both."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ヨハナ、イザナ。本当にありがとう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna, Izana. From the bottom of my heart, thank you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "売れないアイドルだった拙者が、これほど大きな舞台に\n臨めるのは、二人の力あってこそでござる",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I was a nobody of an idol, and the only reason I get to stand on a stage this big is because of the two of you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それはアタシも同じだよ。\n鬼門にはいっぱい助けられたもん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It goes both ways, you know. You've helped me out so many times too."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ね、ヨハナもそう思うでしょ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Right, Johanna? You feel the same, don't you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そ、そうね……確かに、あんたのアドバイスに\n助けられたこともなくはなかったし……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "W-well... I won't deny that your advice has come in handy more than once..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あんたがいなかったら『Ｃｕｔｉｅ☆ＡｎｉｍａＬ』は\nまとまらなかったと思う",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Without you, I don't think Cutie☆AnimalL would have held together at all."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鬼門がリーダーでよかったわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm glad you're our leader."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん！\u3000ありがとね、リーダー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah! Thank you, Leader!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "二人とも……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You two..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "正直、手の掛かるメンバーだったのは確かでござるな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I won't pretend you weren't a handful."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "むむ……子ども扱いして！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey! Don't treat us like children!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "しかし、この三人でよかった。それは確かだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even so... I wouldn't trade this trio for anything. That much I know."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（……拙者が辞めた後、\n\u3000『Ｃｕｔｉｅ☆ＡｎｉｍａＬ』はどうなるのだろう）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(...After I step down, what becomes of Cutie☆AnimalL?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（二人は、どうするつもりなのだろう）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(What do these two plan to do?)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（……いや、終わった後のことを話すには早すぎるか）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(...No. It's too soon to be thinking about after.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……いいライブにしよう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Let's give them a show to remember."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Absolutely!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]